{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/947880-what-s-your-favorite-principle","id":947880,"title":"What's Your Favorite Principle?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-10T10:56:45-07:00","id":947880,"title":"What's Your Favorite Principle?","content":"Hey guys,so i was re-reading my copy of Promethean. And one of my favorite bits was the multiple theories about just what the Principle and Qashamllins are. And i got curious,which theory do you guys think are the most interesting? and which one do you think it's the truth?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T12:42:47-07:00","id":947961,"title":"","content":"I liked both the by-product of sentience and the hyper evolution force. I might use a mix of both in my campaigns. As for which one is true, I don't think we'll ever get a definite answer <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10272-daigotsu-max","name":"Daigotsu Max","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T12:48:34-07:00","id":947965,"title":"","content":"The Principle is the Divine Fire; the raw substance of <i>life</i>, given sentience and Purpose. It built a shell that was its opposite and waged war on itself---Azoth vs Flux, writ large: order vs chaos...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T13:00:04-07:00","id":947974,"title":"","content":"The idea of the princidle being the epitome of evolution and that it's trying to help prometheans finish the pilgrimage because it believes it makes them better really ressonated with me<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T13:05:50-07:00","id":947982,"title":"","content":"I like the idea of the Principle &quot;investing&quot; Pyros in Prometheans. Basically, the Principle is trying to grow in power, so he places some Pyros in the Created and watch them grow in power. When their Azoth increases, that's a good thing, and when they become human, that whole, powered-up pyros returns back to the Principle. And if they die in the process? Well, it gets back to it anyway.<br /> <br /> Why does the Principle want to grow in power? No idea. Maybe it tries to gather enough energy to Transmute the whole universe out of the Lie, maybe there's no real objective beyond growing in power.<br /> <br /> If that theory is true, Prometheans would start to increase in numbers, and that would be weird fast","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Glorious Useless-Post Prana<br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Cost: 2</span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">m; </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mins: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Linguistics 1, Essence 1 </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Type: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Simple</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Keywords: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mute</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Duration: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Instant</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Prerequisite Charms: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Ten-Characters Methodology</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2589-magnum-opus","name":"Magnum Opus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2589_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"821"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T13:22:02-07:00","id":947996,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnum Opus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/947880-what-s-your-favorite-principle?p=947982#post947982\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like the idea of the Principle &quot;investing&quot; Pyros in Prometheans. Basically, the Principle is trying to grow in power, so he places some Pyros in the Created and watch them grow in power. When their Azoth increases, that's a good thing, and when they become human, that whole, powered-up pyros returns back to the Principle. And if they die in the process? Well, it gets back to it anyway.<br /> <br /> Why does the Principle want to grow in power? No idea. Maybe it tries to gather enough energy to Transmute the whole universe out of the Lie, maybe there's no real objective beyond growing in power.<br /> <br /> If that theory is true, Prometheans would start to increase in numbers, and that would be weird fast</div> </div> </div> </div>What if Extemporae happens when the Principle wants a new investmen,in hopes those promethean would do the job faster?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T00:56:50-07:00","id":948432,"title":"","content":"The Principle is to the Empyrean what Kinetic Energy is to Potential one- the same thing in essence, but the manifestation is quit different. It is the first dogma, the first set of laws formed when the ancient &quot;Prometheus&quot; looked at the heavens and stole the Divine Fire to separate right from wrong. That division has divided the Principle itself- what is &quot;right&quot; is Elpis, what is &quot;wrong&quot; is Flux. It always work toward change- reward and punishment, creation and destruction, all in order to transform the world according to the ideas of behind its creation. It is the Principle of Justice, the Principle of Judgement, the Principle of Heaven and Earth- or, in sort, the Principle.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T09:34:21-07:00","id":949358,"title":"","content":"I view Azoth as 'beneficial change' and Flux as 'harmful change', rather than 'good and evil'.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T11:10:15-07:00","id":949430,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Demigod Beast</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/947880-what-s-your-favorite-principle?p=949358#post949358\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I view Azoth as 'beneficial change' and Flux as 'harmful change', rather than 'good and evil'.</div> </div> </div> </div>Beneficial and harmful isn't really less subjective than good and evil, they are practically substitutions for the same meaning. If you want to divorce Azoth and Flux fro morality, wouldn't it be better to call Azoth &quot;constructive change&quot; and Flux &quot;destructive change&quot;? In the evolution model of the Principle, mutation and natural selection, respectively.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":269,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","user":"Charlaquin","date":". 08-12-2016, 02:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T13:14:04-07:00","id":949486,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/947880-what-s-your-favorite-principle?p=949430#post949430\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Beneficial and harmful isn't really less subjective than good and evil, they are practically substitutions for the same meaning. If you want to divorce Azoth and Flux fro morality, wouldn't it be better to call Azoth &amp;quot;constructive change&amp;quot; and Flux &amp;quot;destructive change&amp;quot;? In the evolution model of the Principle, mutation and natural selection, respectively.</div> </div> </div> </div>Your terminology is more appropriate, and captures my intent! Thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}